{"id":"vod_bf_16314","vodId":"16314","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"记录的地平线第二季","name_cn":"记录的地平线第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/733141b81223480bc0a163f0952fdd69.jpg"},"summary":"记录的地平线（LOG HORIZON）改编自日本网络小说家橙乃真希（橙乃ままれ）自2010年4月起在日本小说投稿网站“小说家になろう”上刊载，并由Enterbrain出版书籍的小说。城惠等「冒险者们」，被关进网络游戏《幻境神话》的世界中，已经度过了半年。当初充满着混乱的都市秋叶原，经历了自治组织〈圆桌会议〉的结成，取回了活力和平稳。更借着桑托利夫半岛的地精防卫战，与游戏世界的居民“大地人”加深了彼此间的信赖。大地人贵族龙头的柯文家的千金——蕾妮希雅，作为大使前往了秋叶原赴任。渐渐踏入冬季，冒险者们，对于在这个异世界该怎样行动、该以什么作为目标，各自地摸索着。不论是，秋叶原的街头、西方的都市、北方的大地、甚至是遥远的异国，冒险者们的思想将会相互碰撞、交错。《记录的地平线》第2期。将会有什么样的冒险，等待着城惠和他的同伴们呢！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:25:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipin